e older Triton — testing that now).\n\n**3. There's still a genuine argument for merging, just not the stated one.** On config `(32,8,69,128)` the forward error is **3.6e-3 against an atol of 5e-3** — consuming 73% of the tolerance budget. The repo's own test seeds nothing (`torch.randn` with no `manual_seed`), so the margin is redrawn every run. That's a flaky test waiting to happen, and the PR removes the flakiness entirely by taking the error to ~1e-6.\n\nCombined with the Turing crash fix, the PR looks worth taking — but the PR description as written is misleading and shouldn't be merged with that justification unrebutted.\n\nStill pending: the 3090, and the Triton 3.1.0 rebuild on the 4090 that should explain the reporter's numbers.","type":"text"}],"diagnostics":null,"id":"msg_011CerEmmE8Exfc7AmcWXNzb","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1384,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":1384,"cache_read_input_tokens":100015,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":2,"iterations":[{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1384,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":1384,"cache_read_input_tokens":100015,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":832,"type":"message"}],"output_tokens":832,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_fetch_requests":0,"web_search_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"}},"parentUuid":"c1d18530-3fa6-404b-bc3c-b8d6542e3d7a","requestId":"req_011CerEmkMYBbTx7k99mGQhH","sessionId":"c8f120f6-7e7f-406a-837c-50af362cae2c","sessionKind":"bg","session_id":"c8f120f6-7e7f-406a-837c-50af362cae2c","timestamp":"2026-09-08T15:50:52.213Z","type":"assistant","userType":"external","uuid":"02965dc1-bb5d-42a5-9d18-ab36f884ca90","version":"2.1.263"},"format":"claude-code-jsonl/1"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-08T15:50:53.657Z","schema"